flowchart TD
    A[Start or queued run] --> B[Build spatial grids]
    B --> C[Compute 35 sensor inputs]
    C --> D[GPU neural inference]
    D --> E[Update energy and age]
    E --> F[Apply movement]
    F --> G[Resolve food interactions]
    G --> H[Resolve predator-prey combat]
    H --> I[Select reproduction pairs\ncrossover, mutate, compile offspring]
    I --> J[Advance tick counters]
    J --> K{Report interval reached?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Refresh metrics and species summaries]
    L --> M[Write CSV and JSON artifacts]
    K -->|No| N{UI refresh due?}
    M --> N
    N -->|Yes| O[Publish render snapshot\nand selected-agent data]
    N -->|No| P[Continue or finish]
    O --> P
